msgid "Welcome to Saifdora"
msgstr "Selamat Datang di Saifdora"

msgid "Previous"
msgstr "Sebelumnya"

msgid "Next"
msgstr "Selanjutnya"

msgid "NVIDIA graphics card detected! Official drivers are not installed."
msgstr "Kartu grafis NVIDIA terdeteksi! Driver resmi belum terpasang."

msgid "Install NVIDIA & CUDA Driver"
msgstr "Pasang Driver NVIDIA & CUDA"

msgid "Show on startup"
msgstr "Tampilkan saat memulai"

msgid "Ready Out of the Box"
msgstr "Siap Pakai"

msgid ""
"Saifdora Silverblue 45 includes comprehensive codecs, hardware acceleration,"
" and essential utilities pre-configured."
msgstr ""
"Saifdora Silverblue 45 menyertakan codec lengkap, akselerasi perangkat "
"keras, dan utilitas penting."

msgid "Multimedia & Hardware Acceleration"
msgstr "Multimedia & Akselerasi Perangkat Keras"

msgid ""
"Full codec support (HEVC, AV1, HEIC) and hardware video decoding for Intel "
"and AMD."
msgstr ""
"Dukungan penuh codec (HEVC, AV1, HEIC) dan akselerasi untuk Intel dan AMD."

msgid "Curated Repositories"
msgstr "Repositori Terpilih"

msgid "Flathub and RPM Fusion (Free & Non-Free) enabled out of the box."
msgstr "Flathub dan RPM Fusion diaktifkan secara default."

msgid "Global Localization"
msgstr "Dukungan Bahasa Global"

msgid ""
"Full support for 12 languages with completed GNOME 51 translations and "
"international fonts."
msgstr "Dukungan 12 bahasa dengan terjemahan GNOME 51 dan font internasional."

msgid "Archiving & Documents"
msgstr "Pengarsipan & Dokumen"

msgid ""
"Integrated support for 7-Zip, RAR, ZIP, PDF tools, and high-performance "
"image processing."
msgstr "Dukungan terintegrasi untuk 7-Zip, RAR, ZIP, dan dokumen."

msgid "Integrated Productivity Apps"
msgstr "Aplikasi Produktivitas Terintegrasi"

msgid ""
"High-performance desktop applications installed natively in your system."
msgstr "Aplikasi desktop berkinerja tinggi yang terpasang secara native."

msgid "Rumman (File & Media Converter)"
msgstr "Rumman (Konverter Berkas & Media)"

msgid "High-performance media converter and file optimizer."
msgstr "Konverter media cepat dan pengoptimal berkas."

msgid "Launch Rumman"
msgstr "Buka Rumman"

msgid "Mister Download Manager"
msgstr "Mister Download Manager"

msgid "Fast download manager automatically integrated with Firefox."
msgstr "Pengelola unduhan cepat yang terintegrasi dengan Firefox."

msgid "Launch MDM"
msgstr "Buka MDM"

msgid "ZapFast"
msgstr "ZapFast"

msgid "Fast native desktop WhatsApp client built with Rust."
msgstr "Klien desktop WhatsApp yang cepat dan native dibuat dengan Rust."

msgid "Launch ZapFast"
msgstr "Buka ZapFast"

msgid "Interface Customization & Extensions"
msgstr "Kustomisasi Antarmuka & Ekstensi"

msgid ""
"Enhance and personalize your GNOME desktop with pre-configured extensions "
"and utilities."
msgstr ""
"Personalisasi desktop GNOME Anda dengan ekstensi yang telah disiapkan."

msgid "Pre-Activated Extensions"
msgstr "Ekstensi Pra-Aktif"

msgid "ArcMenu, Dash to Dock, Clipboard Indicator, and Adwaita Lock Clock."
msgstr "ArcMenu, Dash to Dock, Clipboard Indicator, dan Adwaita Lock Clock."

msgid "Extension Manager"
msgstr "Pengelola Ekstensi"

msgid "Search, install, and update GNOME Shell extensions seamlessly."
msgstr "Cari, pasang, dan perbarui ekstensi GNOME Shell dengan mudah."

msgid "Manage Extensions"
msgstr "Kelola Ekstensi"

msgid "Refine"
msgstr "Refine"

msgid "Tweak hidden GNOME settings, fonts, and desktop behavior."
msgstr "Sesuaikan pengaturan tersembunyi GNOME, font, dan perilaku sistem."

msgid "Customize Desktop"
msgstr "Kustomisasi Desktop"

msgid "Hardware & Graphics Drivers"
msgstr "Perangkat Keras & Driver Grafis"

msgid ""
"Optimized for smooth performance across Intel, AMD, and NVIDIA hardware."
msgstr "Kinerja mulus untuk perangkat keras Intel, AMD, dan NVIDIA."

msgid "Intel & AMD Acceleration"
msgstr "Akselerasi Intel & AMD"

msgid ""
"Hardware video acceleration (VA-API / Mesa / Intel Media Driver) is pre-"
"configured and active."
msgstr "Akselerasi video perangkat keras telah dikonfigurasi dan aktif."

msgid "NVIDIA & CUDA Drivers"
msgstr "Driver NVIDIA & CUDA"

msgid ""
"Detect your GPU model, install official drivers, configure CUDA, and manage "
"Secure Boot."
msgstr "Deteksi model GPU Anda, pasang driver resmi, dan atur CUDA."

msgid "Open NVIDIA Manager"
msgstr "Buka Pengelola NVIDIA"

msgid "GNOME 51 Navigation Basics"
msgstr "Dasar Navigasi GNOME 51"

msgid ""
"Master simple gestures and shortcuts to move swiftly through your workspace."
msgstr "Kuasai gerakan dan pintasan mudah untuk bernavigasi dengan cepat."

msgid "Super Key & Search"
msgstr "Tombol Super & Pencarian"

msgid ""
"Press the Super (Windows) key to open the Activities Overview, search apps, "
"files, or do quick math."
msgstr ""
"Tekan tombol Super untuk membuka Ikhtisar Aktivitas dan mencari aplikasi "
"atau berkas."

msgid "Touchpad Gestures"
msgstr "Gestur Panel Sentuh"

msgid ""
"Swipe up/down with 3 fingers for Overview; swipe left/right with 3 fingers "
"to switch workspaces."
msgstr ""
"Usap 3 jari ke atas/bawah untuk Ikhtisar; kiri/kanan untuk berpindah ruang "
"kerja."

msgid "Dynamic Workspaces"
msgstr "Ruang Kerja Dinamis"

msgid ""
"Workspaces are created automatically as you open windows to keep your "
"desktop organized."
msgstr ""
"Ruang kerja dibuat otomatis saat membuka jendela agar desktop tetap rapi."

msgid "Get Started"
msgstr "Mulai"

msgid ""
"Application installation is completing in the background, it will appear in "
"the menu within minutes"
msgstr ""
"Pemasangan aplikasi sedang diselesaikan di latar belakang, akan muncul di "
"menu dalam beberapa menit"
